<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8434] .NET: Service proxies do not work on .NET Core</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8434</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Service proxies do not work on .NET Core because of conditional compilation in &lt;tt&gt;ServiceProxyTypeGenerator&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We only compile for a single target, so &lt;tt&gt;NETCOREAPP2_0&lt;/tt&gt; branch is never used.&lt;br/&gt;
Except in tests, so they pass.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
