                            <comment id="16466372" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 7 May 2018 19:42:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Another issue found: if service interface inherits another interface, proxy generation fails (we do not handle interface hierarchy when generating proxies).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is also a regression from &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7281&quot; title=&quot;.NET: Services do not work on .NET Core&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-7281&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-7281&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
